<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Kinetic Concepts upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Kinetic Concepts upgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Bear Stearns upgraded Kinetic Concepts Inc to buy from attractive, a Bear Stearns source said.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Kinetic Concepts gained 3/8 to 11-3/4 in morning trading.</p>
<p>(( -- Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
